ratures.\\n\\nPlease refrain from consuming the product if the packaging appears to be unsealed.\\n\\nShould you have anymore questions, do not hesitate to contact us!\",\"options\":[{\"label\":\"Customer Experience\",\"value\":\"Customer Experience\"},{\"label\":\"Main Menu\",\"value\":\"MENU\"},{\"label\":\"Chat with CS\",\"value\":\"CS\"}]}]', '[{\"id\":\"node_fbb7a189\",\"label\":\"Order\",\"value\":\"Order\",\"response\":\"\\ud83d\\udce6 *Order Assistance*\\nWe are here to assist you with your order. Please choose an option below:\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_05f99360\",\"label\":\"Order Status\",\"value\":\"Order Status\",\"response\":\"Orders are typically fulfilled within 2-3 business days. Once your order has been fulfilled, a shipping confirmation email and WhatsApp message will be sent with your tracking information.\\n\\nShould you have anymore questions, do not hesitate to contact us!\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_4abde28a\",\"label\":\"Cancellation\",\"value\":\"Cancellation\",\"response\":\"We process and complete orders as quickly as possible. If you have any modification requests or cancellation, please contact our Customer Support team immediately with your Order ID.\\n\\nShould you have anymore questions, do not hesitate to contact us!\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_f54d4511\",\"label\":\"Return Policy\",\"value\":\"Return Policy\",\"response\":\"All forms of order errors and damage to goods during delivery are not our responsibility. Please ensure you inspect your package upon arrival and record an unboxing video.\\n\\nFor verified defective items, please reach out to our Customer Support team with your order number and unboxing video for resolution.\\n\\nShould you have anymore questions, do not hesitate to contact us!\",\"children\":[]}]}]}]},{\"id\":\"node_623d50d1\",\"label\":\"Product\",\"value\":\"Product\",\"response\":\"\\u2615 *Product Assistance*\\nThank you for shopping with Supresso Coffee. We are here to assist you with our products. Please select what you need:\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_a80a82b9\",\"label\":\"Cannot Find Product\",\"value\":\"Cannot Find Product\",\"response\":\"Thank you for shopping with Supresso Coffee.\\n\\nKindly fill up below the product information:\\nProduct name:\\n\\nWe\'ll get back to you with further information :)\\n\\nShould you have anymore questions, do not hesitate to contact us!\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_5b05fd62\",\"label\":\"Add to Cart Error\",\"value\":\"Add to Cart Error\",\"response\":\"Thank you for shopping with Supresso Coffee.\\n\\nKindly fill up below the information:\\nUsername:\\n\\nWe\'ll check with our team and get back to you the soonest!\\n\\nShould you have anymore questions, do not hesitate to contact us!\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_158f2127\",\"label\":\"Price Adjustment\",\"value\":\"Price Adjustment\",\"response\":\"supresso.com does not have a price match guarantee.\\n\\nShould you have anymore questions, do not hesitate to contact us!\",\"children\":[]}]}]}]},{\"id\":\"node_5cf01909\",\"label\":\"Membership\",\"value\":\"Membership\",\"response\":\"\\ud83d\\udc64 *Membership & Account*\\nWe are here to assist you with your Supresso membership and account. Please select an option below:\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_d69812d2\",\"label\":\"Account Login Issue\",\"value\":\"Account Login Issue\",\"response\":\"\\ud83d\\udd10 *Account Login*\\nPlease let us know the issue you are facing with your account:\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_a2b866fd\",\"label\":\"Cannot Login\",\"value\":\"Cannot Login\",\"response\":\"Thank you for shopping with Supresso Coffee.\\n\\nKindly fill up below the information:\\nUsername \\/ Email:\\n\\nWe\'ll check with our team and get back to you the soonest!\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_45b78312\",\"label\":\"Reset Password\",\"value\":\"Reset Password\",\"response\":\"To reset your password:\\n1. Go to the login page on supresso.com\\n2. Click on \'Forgot your password?\'\\n3. Enter your registered email address\\n4. Follow the instructions sent to your email to set a new password.\\n\\nShould you have anymore questions, do not hesitate to contact us!\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_03d6f903\",\"label\":\"Forgot Password\",\"value\":\"Forgot Password\",\"response\":\"If you forgot your password, please click \'Forgot Password\' on the login screen and enter your email address. A password reset link will be sent to your inbox shortly.\\n\\nShould you have anymore questions, do not hesitate to contact us!\",\"children\":[]}]}]}]},{\"id\":\"node_e49d32c1\",\"label\":\"Suspicious Activity\",\"value\":\"Suspicious Activity\",\"response\":\"Kindly provide your email address to proceed further, e.g. yourname@mail.com.\\n\\nOur security team will investigate immediately.\",\"children\":[]},{\"id\":\"node_a9e3d39b\",\"label\":\"Unsubscribe\",\"value\":\"Unsubscribe\",\"response\":\"We\'re sorry to see you go! If you\'re still interested in purchasing our products, you can find them on supresso.com, Shopee, and Lazada. We\'ll also be offering more deals soon. Hope to see you again!\\n\\nTo unsubscribe from our newsletter, click the \'Unsubscribe\' link at the bottom of our emails or send \'Unsubscribe\' to our WhatsApp at +65 8792 0780.\\n\\nShould you have anymore questions, do not hesitate to contact us!\",\"children\":[]}]},{\"id\":\"node_b9218cac\",\"label\":\"About Event\",\"value\":\"About Event\",\"response\":\"\\ud83e\\udd1d *About Event, Partnership & Bulk Purchase*\\nInterested in partnering or purchasing in bulk with Supresso Coffee? Please choose an option below:\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_d7b54d97\",\"label\":\"How to be a Distributor\",\"value\":\"How to be a Distributor\",\"response\":\"For Supresso Coffee, our distributors will place orders directly for our fresh coffee from our manufacturer in Indonesia, with a minimum order of 1 pallet. Please feel free to send your inquiries of the product you\'re interested in to our email:\\nsg@supresso.com \\/ adm_si@supresso.com for more information, or simply chat with us here. Thank you!\\n\\nShould you have anymore questions, do not hesitate to contact us!\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_6e620d37\",\"label\":\"Bulk Order\",\"value\":\"Bulk Order\",\"response\":\"Supresso Coffee is available for wholesale purchase with minimum order quantity. The shipment will be shipped directly from our manufacturer in Indonesia to your door (terms and conditions apply).\\n\\nPlease send your inquiry to sg@supresso.com \\/ adm_si@supresso.com or contact us at +65 8792 0780.\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_0d105efc\",\"label\":\"Office Needs\",\"value\":\"Office Needs\",\"response\":\"Supresso Coffee is available to supply coffee for offices, hotel and other business sectors.\\n\\nGet a quote by sending us email at sg@supresso.com \\/ adm_si@supresso.com or contact us at +65 8792 0780 for more information.\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_1e6e95a9\",\"label\":\"Event Supply\",\"value\":\"Event Supply\",\"response\":\"Supresso Coffee is available to supply coffee for your events such as weddings, private parties, etc.\\n\\nPlease contact us at +65 8792 0780 or email sg@supresso.com \\/ adm_si@supresso.com to fill in your order details and we will get back to you with quotation.\\n\\nShould you have anymore questions, do not hesitate to contact us!\",\"children\":[]}]}]}]},{\"id\":\"node_4eb84df7\",\"label\":\"Promote Our Products\",\"value\":\"Promote Our Products\",\"response\":\"Supresso Coffee is open for endorsement. Kindly send your proposal to our email sg@supresso.com \\/ adm_si@supresso.com to get more info or simply chat with us here. Thank you!\\n\\nShould you have anymore questions, do not hesitate to contact us!\",\"children\":[]}]},{\"id\":\"node_0d02ddc4\",\"label\":\"Checkout\",\"value\":\"Checkout\",\"response\":\"\\ud83d\\uded2 *Checkout Assistance*\\nWe are here to assist you with your checkout and payment. Please select an option:\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_0e818928\",\"label\":\"Kris+ Voucher\",\"value\":\"Kris+ Voucher\",\"response\":\"Redeem your Kris+ vouchers for an extra 20% OFF* exclusive on our website!\\n\\nT&C*:\\n1. This SGD 10 promo code must be redeemed by 30 June 2025.\\n2. No extensions are allowed.\\n3. Valid for redemption online at Supresso official website (supresso.com).\\n4. Promo codes are valid only for full-priced items and cannot be applied to discounted or promotional items, it is only valid for transactions above SGD 30.\\n5. Orders above SGD 30 will be entitled to free shipping.\\n6. Limited to 1 redemption per order (one-time usage only).\\n\\nShould you have anymore questions, do not hesitate to contact us!\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_c2810286\",\"label\":\"Checkout Button\",\"value\":\"Checkout Button\",\"response\":\"Thank you for shopping with Supresso Coffee.\\n\\nIf the checkout button is not responding:\\n1. Ensure all mandatory fields (name, full shipping address, postal code) are filled.\\n2. Check if selected items are currently in stock.\\n3. Try refreshing your browser or clearing cache.\\n\\nIf the problem persists, kindly provide your username and screenshot to our team.\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_72becdf7\",\"label\":\"Payment Methods\",\"value\":\"Payment Methods\",\"response\":\"\\ud83d\\udcb3 *Payment Methods at Supresso Coffee*\\nWe support various secure payment methods worldwide. Please select for details:\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_3e558ff3\",\"label\":\"Credit\\/Debit Cards\",\"value\":\"Credit\\/Debit Cards\",\"response\":\"\\u2022 Credit\\/Debit Cards: We accept Visa, Mastercard, and American Express worldwide.\\n\\u2022 Paypal: Available worldwide. At checkout, choose Paypal as the payment method and log into your PayPal account.\\n\\u2022 Apple Pay: Available in supported countries on mobile version.\\n\\u2022 Google Pay: Available worldwide.\\n\\u2022 Union Pay: Available in supported countries.\\n\\u2022 Shop Pay: Available in the United States.\\n\\nShould you have anymore questions, do not hesitate to contact us!\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_c1d544e7\",\"label\":\"Shop Pay Installment\",\"value\":\"Shop Pay Installment\",\"response\":\"To pay for an order using Shop Pay Installments, the following eligibility criteria apply:\\n\\n\\u2022 You need to have a United States billing address, and be signed up for Shop Pay.\\n\\u2022 Your order needs to be between 50 USD and 20,000 USD, including shipping and taxes.\\n\\u2022 If you\'re ordering a physical product that requires shipping, then you need to provide a United States shipping address. If you\'re only purchasing digital products, then a United States shipping address isn\'t required.\",\"children\":[]}]},{\"id\":\"node_158f2127\",\"label\":\"Price Adjustment\",\"value\":\"Price Adjustment\",\"response\":\"supresso.com does not have a price match guarantee.\\n\\nShould you have anymore questions, do not hesitate to contact us!\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_a80a82b9\",\"label\":\"Cannot Find Product\",\"value\":\"Cannot Find Product\",\"response\":\"Thank you for shopping with Supresso Coffee.\\n\\nKindly fill up below the product information:\\nProduct name:\\n\\nWe\'ll get back to you with further information :)\\n\\nShould you have anymore questions, do not hesitate to contact us!\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_5b05fd62\",\"label\":\"Add to Cart Error\",\"value\":\"Add to Cart Error\",\"response\":\"Thank you for shopping with Supresso Coffee.\\n\\nKindly fill up below the information:\\nUsername:\\n\\nWe\'ll check with our team and get back to you the soonest!\\n\\nShould you have anymore questions, do not hesitate to contact us!\",\"children\":[]}]}]}]},{\"id\":\"node_3a80c11a\",\"label\":\"Order Issue\",\"value\":\"Order Issue\",\"response\":\"\\ud83d\\udce6 *Order Issue Support*\\nWe are here to help your order issue. Please select the specific issue:\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_beb436b0\",\"label\":\"Package Not Received\",\"value\":\"Package Not Received\",\"response\":\"Thank you for shopping with Supresso Coffee.\\n\\nKindly fill up below the information:\\nOrder ID:\\nFull Name:\\nContact Number:\\n\\nWe\'ll check with our logistics partner and get back to you the soonest!\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_db5e7f6a\",\"label\":\"Shipment Issue\",\"value\":\"Shipment Issue\",\"response\":\"\\ud83d\\ude9a *Shipment Assistance*\\nWe are here to help your shipment issue:\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_f8044b16\",\"label\":\"Cannot Add Full Address\",\"value\":\"Cannot Add Full Address\",\"response\":\"Thank you for shopping with Supresso Coffee.\\n\\nKindly fill up below the information:\\nUsername \\/ Email:\\nComplete Shipping Address:\\nPostal Code:\\n\\nOur team will assist in updating your address manually :)\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_b9da7225\",\"label\":\"Shipping Options\",\"value\":\"Shipping Options\",\"response\":\"Enjoy Complimentary Shipping on orders over S$30!\\n\\nShipping options: Ninjavan, J&T, QExpress.\\n\\nPlease allow 3 to 10 business days from the time you place your order to receive your package. During times of high order volume OR public holidays, extra time may be needed for your order to arrive.\\n\\nShould you have anymore questions, do not hesitate to contact us!\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_59f74bf9\",\"label\":\"Currency\",\"value\":\"Currency\",\"response\":\"We display and collect payment in your local currency. Please ensure you\'ve selected your shipping destination in the country selector in the header to see prices and checkout in your local currency and payment methods.\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_081960cd\",\"label\":\"Taxes & Duties\",\"value\":\"Taxes & Duties\",\"response\":\"Duties and taxes are included or paid at checkout for most countries.\\n\\nSingapore: Duties are included in the product price and taxes are paid at checkout for orders shipping to Singapore. You will not be charged additional duties and taxes at delivery.\",\"children\":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{\"