e anymore questions, do not hesitate to contact us!\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_59f74bf9\",\"label\":\"Currency\",\"value\":\"Currency\",\"response\":\"We display and collect payment in your local currency. Please ensure you\'ve selected your shipping destination in the country selector in the header to see prices and checkout in your local currency and payment methods.\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_081960cd\",\"label\":\"Taxes & Duties\",\"value\":\"Taxes & Duties\",\"response\":\"Duties and taxes are included or paid at checkout for most countries.\\n\\nSingapore: Duties are included in the product price and taxes are paid at checkout for orders shipping to Singapore. You will not be charged additional duties and taxes at delivery.\",\"children\":[]}]}]}]},{\"id\":\"node_d566ead4\",\"label\":\"Coffee Recommendations\",\"value\":\"Coffee Recommendations\",\"response\":\"\\u2615 *Supresso Coffee Recommendations*\\nDiscover the finest Indonesian and world coffees crafted to perfection. Choose a variety to see our recommendations:\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_83e755bb\",\"label\":\"Houseblend Coffee\",\"value\":\"Houseblend Coffee\",\"response\":\"Here are our houseblend recommendations:\\n\\u2022 Equilibre Coffee\\n\\u2022 Espresso Coffee\\n\\u2022 Lumiere Coffee\\n\\u2022 Exotic Coffee\\n\\nShould you have anymore questions, do not hesitate to contact us!\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_2e904313\",\"label\":\"Arabica Coffee\",\"value\":\"Arabica Coffee\",\"response\":\"Here are our Arabica single-origin recommendations:\\n\\u2022 Luwak Coffee\\n\\u2022 Toraja Kalosi Coffee\\n\\u2022 Sumatra Mandheling Coffee\\n\\u2022 Flores Bajawa Coffee\\n\\u2022 Aceh Gayo Coffee\\n\\u2022 Signature Coffee\\n\\nShould you have anymore questions, do not hesitate to contact us!\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_e1939b83\",\"label\":\"Robusta Coffee\",\"value\":\"Robusta Coffee\",\"response\":\"Here are our Robusta recommendations:\\n\\u2022 Lampung Coffee\\n\\u2022 Nanyang Coffee\\n\\u2022 Ombre Coffee\\n\\u2022 West Java Coffee\\n\\u2022 Java Coffee\\n\\nShould you have anymore questions, do not hesitate to contact us!\",\"children\":[]}]}]}]},{\"id\":\"node_84e44727\",\"label\":\"Promotions & Deals\",\"value\":\"Promotions & Deals\",\"response\":\"\\u2615 *Current Promotions & Coffee Deals Just For You!*\\nCheck out our ongoing promotions:\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_156ec766\",\"label\":\"Summer Sales\",\"value\":\"Summer Sales\",\"response\":\"Enjoy special Summer Sales discounts on selected Supresso blends and single origins! Check https:\\/\\/www.supresso.com\\/ for the latest coupon codes and bundle deals.\\n\\nShould you have anymore questions, do not hesitate to contact us!\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_cbc72434\",\"label\":\"Father\'s Day Promo\",\"value\":\"Father\'s Day Promo\",\"response\":\"Special Father\'s Day coffee bundle gift sets are available! Discover curated roasts packaged in premium gift boxes on https:\\/\\/www.supresso.com\\/.\\n\\nShould you have anymore questions, do not hesitate to contact us!\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_c28328c8\",\"label\":\"Payday Promo\",\"value\":\"Payday Promo\",\"response\":\"Payday coffee treat! Enjoy complimentary shipping and exclusive voucher codes every month during Payday on supresso.com.\\n\\nShould you have anymore questions, do not hesitate to contact us!\",\"children\":[]}]}]}]},{\"id\":\"node_7315285e\",\"label\":\"Marketing\",\"value\":\"Marketing\",\"response\":\"\\ud83d\\udce2 *Marketing & Promotional Information*\\nStay updated with our latest releases, exclusive discounts, and coffee brewing tips:\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_bba1f1b3\",\"label\":\"Email Marketing\",\"value\":\"Email Marketing\",\"response\":\"Scroll to the bottom of the login page on the website or visit supresso.com to subscribe to our email newsletter. As a subscriber, you\'ll be first to know about exclusive offers, product launches, and more.\\n\\nPlease note that terms & conditions apply.\\n\\nShould you have anymore questions, do not hesitate to contact us!\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_fcebb078\",\"label\":\"WhatsApp Marketing\",\"value\":\"WhatsApp Marketing\",\"response\":\"To subscribe or unsubscribe from our WhatsApp promotional broadcasts, please send a WhatsApp message or reply \'Unsubscribe\' to +65 8792 0780.\\n\\nShould you have anymore questions, do not hesitate to contact us!\",\"children\":[]}]}]},{\"id\":\"node_401b1848\",\"label\":\"Customer Feedback\",\"value\":\"Customer Feedback\",\"response\":\"\\ud83d\\udcac *Customer Experience & Product Care*\\nYour satisfaction is our priority. Please select an option:\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_25952b01\",\"label\":\"Customer Experience\",\"value\":\"Customer Experience\",\"response\":\"\\ud83d\\udcac *Customer Experience & Product Care*\\nYour satisfaction is our priority. Please select an option:\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"node_d8084783\",\"label\":\"Product Care\",\"value\":\"Product Care\",\"response\":\"\\ud83d\\udcac *Customer Experience & Product Care*\\nYour satisfaction is our priority. Please select an option:\",\"children\":[]}]}]}]', 0, NULL, NULL, 0, '{\"mon\":{\"enabled\":true,\"start\":\"08:00\",\"end\":\"17:00\"},\"tue\":{\"enabled\":true,\"start\":\"08:00\",\"end\":\"17:00\"},\"wed\":{\"enabled\":true,\"start\":\"08:00\",\"end\":\"17:00\"},\"thu\":{\"enabled\":true,\"start\":\"08:00\",\"end\":\"17:00\"},\"fri\":{\"enabled\":true,\"start\":\"08:00\",\"end\":\"17:00\"},\"sat\":{\"enabled\":false,\"start\":\"08:00\",\"end\":\"17:00\"},\"sun\":{\"enabled\":false,\"start\":\"08:00\",\"end\":\"17:00\"}}', 'Asia/Jakarta', NULL, NULL, 1, 'ambulance', 7, NULL, 1, 'chime', NULL, 'default', 'fox', 72, 1, 'Reach Us Anywhere Else', '[{\"id\":\"whatsapp_1789554286332\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"name\":\"Facebook\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/supresso.sg\",\"enabled\":true,\"icon\":\"facebook\",\"icon_type\":\"default\",\"custom_icon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"whatsapp_1789554292432